#. STRINGS.NATURALBACKWALLS.OPTIONS.BIOMES_HELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.NATURALBACKWALLS.OPTIONS.BIOMES_HELP"
msgid "Per biome: the backwall material, from the solids found there (None leaves it bare),\nand the coverage, a 0 to 1 band size used when it is not the starting biome."
